  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 402.02 \"Commission\" means \"commission\" as defined in RSA 275-C:1, I, namely, \"the governor's commission on disability.\"\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
